  outcomeRecord: "---\nslug: pitch-compaction\nshipped: 2026-09-25\nschemaVersion: 1\n---\n# pitch-compaction\n\nPitch compaction preserves verified recovery sources and durable coverage before removing live pitch records.\nOriginal source decisions, contradictions and verification limits are retained in the linked supplement.\nThis legacy upgrade makes no new execution or live-quality claim.\n\n- outcome: Pitch compaction preserves verified recovery sources and durable coverage before removing live pitch records.\n- docs: [source supplement](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md)\n- decisions: [retained decisions](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md)\n- knowledge: [lessons and constraints](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md)\n- code: none\n- verification: [historical verification](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md)\n- followups: [retained limits](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md), [backlog](.project/pitches/_followups.md)\n- archive: [reviewed recovery record](.project/records/legacy-upgrades/pitch-compaction.md)\n"
